nt</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 7413, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 141393579, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-01-21", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Sayeed Ahmad And Another vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 21 January, 2021", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 7948, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 146590153, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-02-02", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Iqbal Ahmad vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 2 February, 2021", "numcites": 5, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 7158, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 20044696, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-01-27", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Junaid Khan vs Paschimanchal Vidyut Vitran Khand And 4 ... on 27 January, 2021", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in the case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. In the present case, amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> ... treated as final <b>assessment</b> without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, hence, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts", "docsize": 6462, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 139258401, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-01-27", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Shyami vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 27 January, 2021", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n In this view of the matter, we dispose", "docsize": 5948, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 142990937, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-01-18", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Nadeem vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 18 January, 2021", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 7382, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 185459585, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-02-04", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Durvin Singh vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 4 February, 2021", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in the case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. In the present case, amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> ... treated as final <b>assessment</b> without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, hence, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts", "docsize": 5902, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 109163068, "catids": null, "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2021-02-02", "authorid": null, "bench": [2045, 82], "title": "Vijay Pal Singh vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 2 February, 2021", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>assessment</b>, <b>hearing</b> and final <b>assessment</b> in case of theft of <b>electricity</b>. Amount which is mentioned in the provisional <b>assessment</b> has been treated as final <b>assessment</b> ... without affording any <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b>, the same is in violation of principles of <b>natural</b> <b>justice</b>. \n  \n Considering the facts and circumstances of the case", "docsize": 6919, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court"}, {"tid": 122254165, "catids": [1], "doctype": 1007, "publishdate": "2019-09-18", "authorid": 1303, "bench": [1303], "title": "Tvl.Crescent <b>Electricals</b> vs Assistant Commissioner (Ct) on 18 September, 2019", "numcites": 3, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "other Writ in the <b>nature</b> Writ of\n                      Certiorarified Mandamus, calling for the records pertaining to the order of\n                      <b>assessment</b> in TIN No.338801381157/2012 ... jurisdiction and further directing the respondent to redo the <b>assessment</b> after\n                      providing due <b>opportunity</b> of <b>hearing</b> to the petitioner in accordance with law.\n\n\n\n              